ld. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4061400000000000,"tick":n:40a3200000000000,"day":n:4059c00000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Askheim, believing the world repeats and can be understood is now simply what one does. <b>The Knowing Eye</b> has become a tradition.","custom":s:"c1","x":n:404a595bb1c37453,"y":n:4044c82c75bceefb,},{"id":n:4061600000000000,"tick":n:40a4080000000000,"day":n:405b000000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4061800000000000,"tick":n:40a4860000000000,"day":n:405b800000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Bjorn</b> the secret of Torv's hewer. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"axe",},{"id":n:4061a00000000000,"tick":n:40a4880000000000,"day":n:405b800000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⚖️ <b>Eira</b> wrote the customs down so all were judged by one measure — <b>Eira's the code</b> (Law) has been invented! <i>Custom hardened into law — the institution of justice.</i>","tech":s:"law","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404af8097c0a94bf,"y":n:40403e856f6c7180,"causes":[s:"ev:75",s:"ev:66",],},{"id":n:4061c00000000000,"tick":n:40a49c0000000000,"day":n:405bc00000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏫 <b>Eira</b> set the knowing to teach the young in one place — <b>Eira's the school</b> (School) has been invented! <i>Knowledge taught on purpose — learning outlives the teacher.</i>","tech":s:"school","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404af1e70a872e58,"y":n:4040853c50c9717f,"causes":[s:"ev:75",s:"ev:66",],},{"id":n:4061e00000000000,"tick":n:40a4bc0000000000,"day":n:405bc00000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⛩️ <b>Eira</b> raised a house for the sacred and gathered the faithful in it — <b>Eira's the temple</b> (Temple) has been invented! <i>Belief given a home and a keeper — organized religion.</i>","tech":s:"temple","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404aceabd9da092d,"y":n:403fc2783789f8ec,"causes":[s:"ev:99",],},{"id":n:4062000000000000,"tick":n:40a4be0000000000,"day":n:405bc00000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Bjorn</b> the secret of Ask's hearth. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"kiln",},{"id":n:4062200000000000,"tick":n:40a50c0000000000,"day":n:405c400000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Torv</b> the secret of Embla's glyphs. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:4062400000000000,"tick":n:40a5280000000000,"day":n:405c800000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4062600000000000,"tick":n:40a5840000000000,"day":n:405d000000000000,"year":n:4034000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Liv</b> and <b>Torv</b> have had a child, <b>Saga</b> — generation 3. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:404f31d39d107895,"y":n:4043350dae615b1a,"causes":[s:"agent:5",s:"agent:4",],},{"id":n:4062800000000000,"tick":n:40a5ac0000000000,"day":n:405d000000000000,"year":n:4034000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Torv the Spearmaker</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4010000000000000,},{"id":n:4062a00000000000,"tick":n:40a5e80000000000,"day":n:405d800000000000,"year":n:4034000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ylva</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404e019173d24ca6,"y":n:40437d83eac49387,},{"id":n:4062c00000000000,"tick":n:40a6480000000000,"day":n:405e000000000000,"year":n:4034000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4062e00000000000,"tick":n:40a6680000000000,"day":n:405e000000000000,"year":n:4034000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📚 <b>Eira</b> gathered writings and studied them as a life's work — <b>Eira's the library</b> (Scholarship) has been invented! <i>Knowledge accumulated and compared — the scholar emerges.</i>","tech":s:"scholarship","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404959be97d08050,"y":n:404347ca81ba4704,"causes":[s:"ev:113",s:"ev:142",],},{"id":n:4063000000000000,"tick":n:40a6800000000000,"day":n:405e400000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4063200000000000,"tick":n:40a6900000000000,"day":n:405e400000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎓 <b>Eira</b> joined scholars and students into a lasting house of learning — <b>Eira's the academy</b> (University) has been invented! <i>Learning institutionalized — the engine of every later age.</i>","tech":s:"university","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:40496628ed27e6b7,"y":n:4043b5bdcb197a37,"causes":[s:"ev:151",s:"ev:142",],},{"id":n:4063400000000000,"tick":n:40a6900000000000,"day":n:405e400000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Saga</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:404a000000000000,"y":n:4044000000000000,},{"id":n:4063600000000000,"tick":n:40a6960000000000,"day":n:405e400000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Eira</b> taught <b>Saga</b> the secret of Eira's knife. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sharp",},{"id":n:4063800000000000,"tick":n:40a6da0000000000,"day":n:405ec00000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ylva</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:401c000000000000,},{"id":n:4063a00000000000,"tick":n:40a7680000000000,"day":n:405f800000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪙 <b>Torv</b> stamped a fixed weight of metal all agreed to trust — <b>Torv's the coin</b> (Coinage) has been invented! <i>Money — value made portable; markets and wealth take shape.</i>","tech":s:"coinage","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:405013d3c4fd5cfc,"y":n:4041bafd1c4c50f6,"causes":[s:"ev:123",s:"ev:66",],},{"id":n:4063c00000000000,"tick":n:40a7680000000000,"day":n:405f800000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4063e00000000000,"tick":n:40a7b00000000000,"day":n:405fc00000000000,"year":n:4036000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Liv</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:4052a9938b07b8b4,"y":n:40403ae69db51ac5,"causes":[s:"agent:5",],},{"id":n:4064000000000000,"tick":n:40a7d40000000000,"day":n:4060000000000000,"year":n:4036000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Embla's the argument. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"philosophy",},{"id":n:4064200000000000,"tick":n:40a7fc0000000000,"day":n:4060200000000000,"year":n:4036000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Torv's melody. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"song",},{"id":n:4064400000000000,"tick":n:40a85e0000000000,"day":n:4060600000000000,"year":n:4036000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> tried something with  — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4018000000000000,},{"id":n:4064600000000000,"tick":n:40a8880000000000,"day":n:4060800000000000,"year":n:4036000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4064800000000000,"tick":n:40a8980000000000,"day":n:4060800000000000,"year":n:4036000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Torv's the count. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"numbers",},{"id":n:4064a00000000000,"tick":n:40a8b00000000000,"day":n:4060800000000000,"year":n:40360000