0000000000,"year":n:4042000000000000,"type":s:"knowledgeLost","txt":s:"🕯️ With <b>Torv the Spearmaker</b> died the last knowledge of Torv's tempered blade (Steel). It is <b>extinct</b> — until someone rediscovers it.","tech":s:"steel",},{"id":n:406e200000000000,"tick":n:40b3ba0000000000,"day":n:406a600000000000,"year":n:4042000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Sten</b> and <b>Bjorn</b> have had a child, <b>Kare</b> — generation 3. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4028000000000000,"x":n:4052efce77573936,"y":n:40408643603e057b,"causes":[s:"agent:6",s:"agent:8",],},{"id":n:406e400000000000,"tick":n:40b3ba0000000000,"day":n:406a600000000000,"year":n:4042000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Kare</b> taught <b>Freja</b> the secret of Embla's the argument. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"philosophy",},{"id":n:406e600000000000,"tick":n:40b3cb0000000000,"day":n:406a800000000000,"year":n:4042000000000000,"type":s:"rediscovered","txt":s:"💡 <b>Eira the Rekindler</b> has rediscovered Torv's the coin (Coinage) — knowledge lost for 0 years lives again!","tech":s:"coinage","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404ef0997a8e6ebc,"y":n:403ae2bcb95a1166,"causes":[s:"ev:239",],},{"id":n:406e800000000000,"tick":n:40b3d70000000000,"day":n:406a800000000000,"year":n:4042000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Saga</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4022000000000000,},{"id":n:406ea00000000000,"tick":n:40b3e90000000000,"day":n:406aa00000000000,"year":n:4042000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔬 <b>Liv</b> tested the guess against the world and kept only what held — <b>Liv's experiment</b> (Science) has been invented! <i>The method that unlocks everything after — the modern mind.</i>","tech":s:"science","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:405054b06c61f363,"y":n:40403e98950a79c9,"causes":[s:"ev:113",s:"ev:66",s:"ev:231",],},{"id":n:406ec00000000000,"tick":n:40b3e90000000000,"day":n:406aa0000000000